Privacy Policy - Mazeguard TD
Last updated: 25 November 2026

Lucian Gherghel ("we", "us") publishes the mobile game Mazeguard TD ("the app").

What we collect
Nothing. The app does not collect, transmit or share personal information. It does not require an account and has no advertising or analytics.

What is stored on your device
The app saves your game progress and best scores in local storage on your device so you can continue later. This data never leaves your device. It is removed when you clear the app's data or uninstall the app.

Third parties
The current version contains no third-party advertising, analytics or tracking software.

Children
The app is not directed at children under 13 and we do not knowingly collect information from anyone.

Changes
If we add features that handle personal data (for example ads, accounts or purchases), we will update this policy and the app's Data safety information before releasing them.

